6966450491a4826a109"},"message":"policy: include CapGrant destinations for peer relay capabilities\n\nExtend MatchFromFilterRule to union CapGrant[].Dsts into the rule\ndestination set so grant-only policies produce a complete peer map.\nWithout this, a node receiving capabilities (e.g. cap/relay,\ncap/relay-target) only via a CapGrant could not see the grant issuer\nas a peer, breaking peer relay.\n\nRegression tests:\n- hscontrol/policy/matcher: TestMatchFromFilterRuleIncludesCapGrantDests\n- hscontrol/policy/v2:      TestBuildPeerMapFromAppOnlyRelayGrant\n- integration:              TestGrantCapRelayAppOnly (app-only grant, no IP connectivity)\n\nSigned-off-by: wangrzneu <wangrzneu@gmail.com>","parents":[{"sha":"32e1d77663e50ec607e512640d281857ce5fb3c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/git/commits/32e1d77663e50ec607e512640d281857ce5fb3c8","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/commit/32e1d77663e50ec607e512640d281857ce5fb3c8"}],"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null},"event":"committed"},{"id":24552463131,"node_id":"HRFPE_lADOEFLz887-bCX4zwAAAAW3cNsb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/events/24552463131","actor":{"login":"wangrzneu","id":3406517,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0MDY1MTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3406517?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu","html_url":"https://github.com/wangrzneu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangrzneu/repos","events_